---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout title="About Alex Morgan | Men's Post-Divorce Coaching">
    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <header id="hero" class="section hero-section"
        style="background-color: var(--color-bg-primary); padding: 4rem 2rem 3rem; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;">
        <div style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto;">
             <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 3rem; line-height: 1.2; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 800;">
                About MPDC
            </h1>
             <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
                Rebuilding lives through structure, clarity, and action.
            </p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- STORY CONTENT BLOCK (White Background) -->
    <section class="content-block" style="background-color: var(--color-text-light); padding: 4rem 2rem;">
        <style>
            @media (max-width: 768px) {
                .content-block {
                    padding: 3rem 1.5rem !important;
                }
            }
        </style>
        <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: left;">
            <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-dark);">
                I’m Alex Morgan, the developer of the **Men’s Divorce Mindset System**. My mission is to help high-performance men navigate the biological and psychological fallout of divorce through clarity, structure, and logic-heavy protocols.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-dark);">
                Like many men, my own divorce required me to manually re-examine my identity, priorities, and direction. It was a period that demanded more than just "moving on"—it demanded a total systemic rebuild. Through that process, I recognized a massive gap in how men are supported: most advice is too emotional or too vague for men who value results and precision.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; color: var(--color-text-dark);">
                Since then, I’ve helped over **500 men** move from the "Reactive Spiral" to a state of unshakeable autonomy. My work centers on the intersection of biological stress management, identity reconstruction, and strategic legacy building. 
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--color-text-dark);">
                This isn't just about recovery; it’s about **Sovereignty**. We don't focus on the past or assign blame. We focus on the hardware of your mind and the architecture of your future.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- LEADERSHIP SECTION -->

</Layout>
